Third-party content
-------------------

The following content in this pack comes from third parties under their own
terms.

Moon 01 (base-surfaces/resources/textures/surfaces/regolith/)

From Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com/a/moon_01), by Greg Zaal (photography),
Rico Cilliers (photography), Jenelle van Heerden (photography), Dario Barresi
(processing). Licensed CC0 1.0 Universal, dedicated to the public domain
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Resampled, with the
colour, OpenGL normal and displacement maps compressed into texture arrays.

Moon Meteor 02 (base-surfaces/resources/textures/surfaces/regolith-rocky/)

From Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com/a/moon_meteor_02), by Greg Zaal
(photography), Jenelle van Heerden (processing), Rico Cilliers (photography).
Licensed CC0 1.0 Universal, dedicated to the public domain
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Resampled, with the
colour, OpenGL normal and displacement maps compressed into texture arrays.
